{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hxi8tmceKH1794812115.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產寶翠園第二分行分區營業經理柳志明表示，分行新近促成西環創業中心買賣成交，單位為C座低層H室，實用面積417平方呎，採2房間隔，望街景。單位放盤僅數天，迅迅速以518萬元售出，折合實用呎價12,422元。<br/>柳志明表示，新買家為孝順客，購入單位供母親自住。由於母親曾居於西環，對該區生活環境熟識且希望重返舊地居住，遂拍板購入上址。據悉，原業主於1986年以39.3萬元購入單位，持貨40年，是次轉手賬面獲利478.7萬元，單位升值逾12倍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T07:30:07.946084+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T09:17:15.314154+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T07:23:30.324504+00:00","content_hash":"e530c417bdaee1710e6466f616971c672217a39b8690814a1523a6a400f2afa7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T07:30:07.946084+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}